cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these records, please cite them as below, and credit the table that lists each one."
type: dataset
title: "Quantavane records: released records with certificates, family cells on demand, and living record tables"
abstract: "Every record Quantavane has released (listed by a table's keeper, sent to a keeper, or published by Quantavane), with its parameters, value, previous best and source, status, certificate and checks; a Python package that computes and checks any cell of a family theorem on demand; and living record tables with exact checkers and open submissions."
authors:
  - family-names: Canli
    given-names: Arhan
    affiliation: Quantavane
    email: arhan@quantavane.com
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - MIT
url: "https://quantavane.com"
repository-code: "https://github.com/arhancanli/quantavane-records"
keywords:
  - combinatorial records
  - covering arrays
  - coding theory
  - Ramsey numbers
  - certificates
